WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
We are now moving into our penultimate module,

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.480
Environmental Emergencies.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.640
As the image of the wasp suggests,

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.600
bites from animals, insects, or even humans

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.440
are a major part of this section,

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.760
and they can range from simple irritations

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.600
to life-threatening events.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.680
We'll also explore other important topics

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.760
like ingestion of poisonous substances

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.080
and opioid emergencies and overdoses.

